  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Plastids and ribosomes"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Plastids occur in all plant cells and in euglenoids. Chloroplasts contain chlorophyll and carotenoids; chromoplasts contain fat-soluble carotenoids (yellow, orange, red); leucoplasts are colourless stores: amyloplasts store starch (potato), elaioplasts store oils and fats, and aleuroplasts store proteins. A chloroplast is double-membraned and 5–10 μm long, 2–4 μm wide; Chlamydomonas has one per cell, while a mesophyll cell has 20–40. Thylakoids are stacked into grana, joined by stroma lamellae; the stroma has enzymes for carbohydrate and protein synthesis, circular DNA and 70S ribosomes. Ribosomes were first seen by George Palade (1953); eukaryotic cytoplasmic ribosomes are 80S (60S + 40S). S, the Svedberg unit, is a sedimentation coefficient that reflects density and size."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Amyloplast – starch; elaioplast – oils; aleuroplast – proteins."
    },
    {
     "en": "Prokaryote ribosome 70S (50S + 30S); eukaryote 80S (60S + 40S)."
    },
    {
     "en": "Ribosomes are made of RNA and proteins and have no membrane."
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Plastids occur in all plant cells and in euglenoids. Chloroplasts contain chlorophyll and carotenoids; chromoplasts contain fat-soluble carotenoids (yellow, orange, red); leucoplasts are colourless stores: amyloplasts store starch (potato), elaioplasts store oils and fats, and aleuroplasts store proteins. A chloroplast is double-membraned and 5–10 μm long, 2–4 μm wide; Chlamydomonas has one per cell, while a mesophyll cell has 20–40. Thylakoids are stacked into grana, joined by stroma lamellae; the stroma has enzymes for carbohydrate and protein synthesis, circular DNA and 70S ribosomes. Ribosomes were first seen by George Palade (1953); eukaryotic cytoplasmic ribosomes are 80S (60S + 40S). S, the Svedberg unit, is a sedimentation coefficient that reflects density and size.",
    "kn": "ಪ್ಲಾಸ್ಟಿಡ್‌ಗಳು ಹರಿತ್ತಿಲವಕ, ವರ್ಣಲವಕ ಮತ್ತು ಶ್ವೇತಲವಕ ಎಂದು ಮೂರು ವಿಧ. ಹರಿತ್ತಿಲವಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಗ್ರ್ಯಾನಾ ಮತ್ತು ಸ್ಟ್ರೋಮಾ ಇವೆ. ಯೂಕ್ಯಾರಿಯೋಟಿಕ್ ರೈಬೋಸೋಮ್ 80S, ಪ್ರೋಕ್ಯಾರಿಯೋಟಿಕ್ 70S."
   }
